{
 "encounter_id": "00840",
 "speakers": {
  "person_1": "PATIENT",
  "person_2": "DOCTOR"
 },
 "turns": [
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Doctor. My legs are swollen. Since I started the new blood pressure tablet."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Which tablet, and when did you start it?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Amlodipine. 10 mg. Once a day. Six weeks ago."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Both legs?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Both. Ankles and feet. Worse in the evening."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any breathlessness?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No. None."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any chest pain?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No. Nothing."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "What else do you take?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Metformin. 500 mg. Twice a day."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any other conditions?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Diabetes. And kidney disease. Mild."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any change in the amount of urine? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No. Same. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Let me look at your legs. Sit on the couch. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Okay.",
   "pause": 15.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Both legs are swollen up to the shins, soft and pitting when I press, with no redness or tenderness, and the skin is intact."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Is it my heart? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "The pattern, both legs, after starting amlodipine, with no breathlessness, fits with a known side effect of that tablet. I'd say this is amlodipine-related ankle swelling."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Can it stop? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "It often settles when the dose is lowered or the tablet changed. But because you have kidney disease and diabetes, I want to rule out other causes. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "What do you want? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'd like to arrange blood tests, for your kidney function, and a urine test for protein."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Today? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Please. The nurse will take them. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Fine. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And I'd like to see you again in a week, with the results. I may change your tablet then."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "A week. Okay. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Meanwhile, raise your legs when you sit, and don't stand for long."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Right. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "If you get breathless, chest pain, or one leg becomes much more swollen than the other, or red, come the same day."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I will. ~"
  }
 ],
